          "quote": "This research analyses the variations in copper content (0 – 20 %) concerning the phase constitution, mechanical properties, thermal stability, and magnetism of Titanium – Zirconium – Hafnium – Niobium – Tantalum (Ti – Zr-Hf-Nb-Ta) high-entropy alloys.",
