          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "c48676d176a51ce4:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": 7,
          "section": null,
          "quote": "the variation of hardness (in HV) and yield strength (in MPa) with respect to increasing copper content (Cu wt%) in Ti – Zr-Hf-Nb-Ta high-entropy alloys.",
