          "figure": "Fig. 9",
          "chunk_id": "c48676d176a51ce4:part:002"
        },
        {
          "page": 12,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "TiZrHfNbTa high-entropy alloys (HEAs) exhibit promising properties for high-temperature applications, and the addition of copper (Cu) can further enhance their multifunctionality.",
